# Keep the build context lean and reproducible: never ship local build output, deps, or VCS/state
# into the image. The builder stage runs `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` + `pnpm -r build` itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-types
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# Local Switchboard state / secrets must never enter the build context.
.switchboard
spikes/runtime/.env
